              "text": "kosmos = mankind. (See Scofield \" Mat 4:8 \") .",
              "html": "<p><b>world</b> </p><p>kosmos = mankind. <i>(See Scofield &quot;</i><i><ref>Mat 4:8</ref></i><i>&quot;)</i>. </p>",
              "references": [
