          "text": "Look to yourselves, that we lose not those things which we have wrought, but that we receive a full reward.",
          "marked_text": "Look to yourselves, that we lose not those things which we have wrought, but that we receive a full reward.<fn n=\"i\"/>",
          "outlines": null,
